### ============================================================
###  PE1 — DepartmentService (/api/departments)
###  Status map: 1=OK  2=validation  3=duplicate code  4=not found  0=500
###  Not-found trả HTTP 400 (không phải 404) theo đề.
###
###  CHẠY reset-test-data.sql TRƯỚC MỖI LẦN CHẠY FULL BỘ TEST:
###    sqlcmd -S localhost -U sa -P 12345 -d MSS301_2026_PE -i reset-test-data.sql
###  Seed sau reset — các test dưới bám vào đúng id/code này:
###    id1=HQ01 Head Quarter | id2=FIN01 Finance | id3=OPS01 Operations
###    id4=MKT01 Marketing   | id5=IT01 IT Department   (tất cả ACTIVE)
###  Code dùng để CREATE (QA01/QA02/QA03...) không có trong seed → chạy lại
###  sau khi reset luôn sạch. Không reset mà chạy lần 2 thì 01/02 sẽ ra 400/3.
### ============================================================

### 01. Create department — hợp lệ
# Expect: 201, status=1, data.status="ACTIVE" (service ép), effectiveDate trả dd/MM/yyyy
POST {{masterUrl}}/api/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "QA01",
  "name": "QA Department",
  "location": "Hoa Lac Park",
  "effectiveDate": "01/08/2026",
  "parentId": 1
}

### 02. Create — effectiveDate dạng ISO cũng phải được nhận (deserializer fallback)
# Expect: 201, status=1, response trả "15/08/2026"
POST {{masterUrl}}/api/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "QA02",
  "name": "QA Department 2",
  "location": "Q9 Campus",
  "effectiveDate": "2026-08-15",
  "parentId": 1
}

### 03. Create — trùng code (HQ01 đã có sẵn từ seed id1)
# Expect: 400, status=3, "Department code already exists..."
POST {{masterUrl}}/api/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "HQ01",
  "name": "Duplicate Test"
}

### 04. Create — thiếu code + name (bean validation OnCreate)
# Expect: 400, status=2
POST {{masterUrl}}/api/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "location": "Nowhere"
}

### 05. Create — code có ký tự đặc biệt (phải ^[A-Za-z0-9]+$)
# Expect: 400, status=2
POST {{masterUrl}}/api/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "AB-01!",
  "name": "Bad Code Dept"
}

### 06. Create — code quá 10 ký tự
# Expect: 400, status=2
POST {{masterUrl}}/api/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "ABCDEFGHIJK",
  "name": "Long Code Dept"
}

### 07. Create — effectiveDate đúng biên dưới 01/01/2000 (phải AFTER → bị từ chối)
# Expect: 400, status=2
POST {{masterUrl}}/api/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "QA03",
  "name": "Boundary Low",
  "effectiveDate": "01/01/2000"
}

### 08. Create — effectiveDate quá xa (vượt today+360)
# Expect: 400, status=2
POST {{masterUrl}}/api/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "QA04",
  "name": "Boundary High",
  "effectiveDate": "01/01/2030"
}

### 09. Create — effectiveDate sai format hoàn toàn
# Expect: 400, status=2 ("Request body is invalid")
POST {{masterUrl}}/api/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "QA05",
  "name": "Bad Date Dept",
  "effectiveDate": "not-a-date"
}

### 10. Get detail — id1 từ seed
# Expect: 200, status=1, data.code="HQ01"
GET {{masterUrl}}/api/departments/1

### 11. Get detail — id không tồn tại
# Expect: 400 (KHÔNG phải 404), status=4
GET {{masterUrl}}/api/departments/99999

### 12. Get detail — id sai kiểu
# Expect: 400, status=2 ("departmentId has an invalid value")
GET {{masterUrl}}/api/departments/abc

### 13. Update — partial (chỉ đổi name, các field khác giữ nguyên)
# Expect: 200, status=1, data.name đổi, code="FIN01"/location="HCM City" giữ nguyên
PUT {{masterUrl}}/api/departments/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Finance Department Renamed"
}

### 14. Update — đổi status hợp lệ (id4=MKT01)
# Expect: 200, status=1, data.status="CLOSED"
PUT {{masterUrl}}/api/departments/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CLOSED"
}

### 15. Update — status ngoài enum ACTIVE|INACTIVE|CLOSED
# Expect: 400, status=2
PUT {{masterUrl}}/api/departments/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DELETED"
}

### 16. Update — code trùng với department khác (IT01 đang thuộc id5)
# Expect: 400, status=3
PUT {{masterUrl}}/api/departments/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "IT01"
}

### 17. Update — id không tồn tại
# Expect: 400, status=4
PUT {{masterUrl}}/api/departments/99999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost"
}

### 18. Deactivate (soft delete) — id3=OPS01
# Expect: 200, status=1; chạy lại 10 với id=3 thấy status="INACTIVE", row vẫn còn
DELETE {{masterUrl}}/api/departments/3

### 19. Deactivate — id không tồn tại
# Expect: 400, status=4
DELETE {{masterUrl}}/api/departments/99999

### 20. List — mặc định
# Expect: 200, status=1, data là PageDTO {size,page,totalPages,totalElements,first,last,content}
GET {{masterUrl}}/api/departments

### 21. List — phân trang
# Expect: 200, size=2, page=1
GET {{masterUrl}}/api/departments?page=1&size=2

### 22. List — filter name partial match
# Expect: 200, content chỉ chứa department có "Department" trong name
GET {{masterUrl}}/api/departments?name=Department

### 23. List — filter status
# Expect: 200, content toàn ACTIVE
GET {{masterUrl}}/api/departments?status=ACTIVE

### 24. List — status không hợp lệ
# Expect: 400, status=2
GET {{masterUrl}}/api/departments?status=BOGUS

### 25. List — size vượt max 100
# Expect: 400, status=2
GET {{masterUrl}}/api/departments?size=101

### 26. List — page âm
# Expect: 400, status=2
GET {{masterUrl}}/api/departments?page=-1

### 27. List — page sai kiểu
# Expect: 400, status=2
GET {{masterUrl}}/api/departments?page=xyz
